Based on pyannote.audio models/embedding/wespeaker/resnet.py, commit
b749285c5cdd4636b2edc7f766f1352c8dde9369, SHA256
2de7673e14e8c74d6c430e0b6e6cc844157f47ac35b67ff6238ca2d2c559eba9.
Changes: Go owned/checking API, explicit CHW shape/stride/element bounds,
scalar and existing Plan9 GEMV composition, inference-only BatchNorm,
cooperative cancellation and transient boundary observers. ResNet34 adds
owned stem/[3,4,6,3] composition and shared-trunk pooling/single projection APIs,
with explicit model geometry and mask-support reporting; no full checkpoint load.

